			"notes": "# Command Bookmarks v1.1.0\n\n## New Features\n*   **World & Server Specific Bookmarks:** You can now separate your bookmarks into \"Global\" (shared across all worlds) and \"Local\" (specific to the current singleplayer world or multiplayer server).\n    *   Added a toggle button at the top right of the GUI to easily switch between Global and Local modes.\n    *   The mod will remember your last used mode (Global or Local) for your convenience.\n*   **Automatic Data Migration:** Existing `command_bookmark.json` data from previous versions will automatically and safely be migrated to the new Global storage format upon launch.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/AcaciaTide/Command-Bookmarks/compare/v1.0.0...v1.1.0"
